Script to freshly re-initialize the 'testdata' dir for MultiRename.

- Copy 'mrtestdata.lha' from tools directory to the parent of this MultiRename
development directory: 'copy tools/mrtestdata / CLONE'.
- Copy 'mrreset' to 'SYS:s'
- Also ensure that it has the s bit set: 'protect SYS:s/mrreset +s'
  (s bit gets lost in git)
- Then, just run 'mrreset' from this MultiRename development directory

Uwe Rosner, October 2025

